1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,720
Invest in stocks with this one thought,
and you're 99% sure to lose money.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,970
It's the thought: "I want to
make money fast in stocks."

3
00:00:08,350 --> 00:00:11,464
What? Isn't making money the
whole point of investing?

4
00:00:11,844 --> 00:00:15,474
When you're out to make money,
greed is bound to creep in.

5
00:00:15,854 --> 00:00:19,032
When you profit, you want more, so
you keep buying in bigger amounts,

6
00:00:19,412 --> 00:00:21,760
and when you lose, you want it back fast,

7
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:24,681
so you buy and sell more
often and in bigger sizes.

8
00:00:25,061 --> 00:00:28,636
Then when a big drop comes, the
money to buy more is already gone,

9
00:00:28,636 --> 00:00:30,261
and selling means a huge loss.

10
00:00:30,641 --> 00:00:35,101
At that point, there's nothing you
can do but watch your account fall.

11
00:00:35,481 --> 00:00:37,541
As the saying goes, haste makes waste,

12
00:00:37,921 --> 00:00:41,533
so let go of greed, prepare
for risk and profit slowly,

13
00:00:41,533 --> 00:00:44,291
and one day you'll find yourself a winner.

14
00:00:44,671 --> 00:00:47,871
Curious about other tests? Subscribe
and find them on the channel.
